PARSFILE
#FullDataName Models: Simulink`Radar Active Cruise: Second Car (Ext. Sen.)`Active Cruise Control
#RunMdlFile Extensions\Simulink\Radar_Acc_ExtSen_CS9.mdl
#RunSimCat Ind_Ind`Extensions\Simulink\Multi_Vehicle\i_i2.dll
#RingCtrl0 1
#RingCtrl1 2
OPT_INT_METHOD 2
#CheckBox0 0    
*USE_ALT_DIR 0
#CheckBox1 1    
*USE_DIFF_SOLVERS 1
#CheckBox2 0    
OPT_IO_UPDATE 0
#CheckBox3 0    

*SIM_CODE1 Ind_Ind
*SIM_PATH1 Extensions\Simulink\Multi_Vehicle\i_i2.dll
PARSFILE IO_Channels\I_Channels\Import_4aaad653-9ab6-448d-917c-f7919ba748e2.par
#BlueLink0 I/O Channels: Import`Radar Active Cruising (Ext. Sen.)` ` , Import`Import_4aaad653-9ab6-448d-917c-f7919ba748e2

PARSFILE IO_Channels\O_Channels\Export_cd46af09-813a-451b-b6bb-def0b4b3623a.par
#BlueLink1 I/O Channels: Export`Radar Active Cruise (Ext. Sen.)` ` , Export`Export_cd46af09-813a-451b-b6bb-def0b4b3623a

#BlueLink2 ` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous`

#MiscYellow1
simfile Radar_Acc_ExtSen_Car_2.sim

! If using 64 bit solvers, use Extensions\Simulink\Multi_Vehicle\i_i2_64.dll in the path above
#ENDMYellow

LIVE_SERVER_UPDATE_FREQ_MAX 60

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset is used for an example in which two vehicle models are simulated simultaneously under the control of Simulink. This dataset is used for the second vehicle, which has active radar-based cruise control.
#
#Both Models: Simulink datasets identify the same Simulink model. However, they specify different simfiles and math model DLL files.
#
#This dataset specifies a top-level simfile named "Radar_Acc_ExtSen_Car_2.sim"  which will provide information to the CarSim S-Function about vehicle 2 (i.e., the trailing vehicle).
#
#This dataset also specifies an alternative VS Solver DLL s_s2.dll, which is simply a renamed copy of the built-in solver s_s.dll.
#
#ALERT: If you are running a 64-bit version of Simulink, you must change the pathname to use s_s2_64.dll.
#
#For more details on this example, please see the Technical Memo: "Example: Running Multiple Vehicles in Simulink."
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

LOG_ENTRY Used Dataset: Models: Simulink; { Active Cruise Control } Radar Active Cruise: Second Car (Ext. Sen.)
#Library : Models: Simulink
#DataSet : Radar Active Cruise: Second Car (Ext. Sen.)
#Category: Active Cruise Control
